	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rHow the Egg? Anything changed?\rIf anythin’ happen, call me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rHow the Egg? Anything changed?\rIf anythin’ happen, call me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, this GREAT news!\nA homie hatched from that Egg!\rI knew givin’ that Egg to you,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, was the right move.\fI just KNEW it!\rCome here and show me what\nkinda homie it is!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, this GREAT news!\nA homie hatched from that Egg!\rI knew givin’ that Egg to you,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, was the right move.\fI just KNEW it!\rCome here and show me what\nkinda homie it is!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rI just made a new discovery.\rHow long a Egg take to hatch\ndepend on the homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rI just made a new discovery.\rHow long a Egg take to hatch\ndepend on the homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rIt’s still a mystery what moves\nhatched homies got.\rWe lookin’ into that now.</language>
	</row>
