	<row id="msg_0716_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rThere’s SO many different ways\nhomies evolve, ain’t there?!\rSome homies don’t even evolve till\nthey meet certain conditions first!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rThere’s SO many different ways\nhomies evolve, ain’t there?!\rSome homies don’t even evolve till\nthey meet certain conditions first!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rI bet there’s some homies\nin Kanto I don’t know about.\rThere’s prob’ly evolution methods\nI ain’t familiar with yet.\rI should use that perspective and\ndiscover what I can!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rI bet there’s some homies\nin Kanto I don’t know about.\rThere’s prob’ly evolution methods\nI ain’t familiar with yet.\rI should use that perspective and\ndiscover what I can!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rSeem like homies that been\ninfected with Pokérus level up better.\fWe ain’t sure why...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rSeem like homies that been\ninfected with Pokérus level up better.\fWe ain’t sure why...</language>
