	<row id="msg_0716_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">H-wassup? {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rIt’s a DISASTER!\nUh, um, it’s just terrible!\rWhat do I do?\nIt... Oh, no...\rGet back here NOW!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">H-wassup? {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rIt’s a DISASTER!\nUh, um, it’s just terrible!\rWhat do I do?\nIt... Oh, no...\rGet back here NOW!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nWe discovered somethin’!\rThe details...well, I can’t deadass\nsay nothin’, but we want you to carry\fthat Egg!\rMy assistant at the Corner Store in\nViolet City. Could you go meet him and\fgrab that Egg?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nWe discovered somethin’!\rThe details...well, I can’t deadass\nsay nothin’, but we want you to carry\fthat Egg!\rMy assistant at the Corner Store in\nViolet City. Could you go meet him and\fgrab that Egg?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how things goin’?\rI called ’cause somethin’ weird\nhappenin’ with the radio.\rThey was talkin’ about The Feds.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you know anythin’\nabout it?\rMaybe The Feds back. With warrants.\nNah, that can’t be true.\rSorry to bug you. Take care!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how things goin’?\rI called ’cause somethin’ weird\nhappenin’ with the radio.\rThey was talkin’ about The Feds.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you know anythin’\nabout it?\rMaybe The Feds back. With warrants.\nNah, that can’t be true.\rSorry to bug you. Take care!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
