	<row id="msg_0716_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rI found somethin’ weird.\nApparently there’s somethin’ called\fPokérus that infect homies.\rYeah, it’s like a virus, so it’s\ncalled Pokérus.\rIt spread fast and infect other\nhomies too. But that’s it.\rIt don’t seem to do nothin’, and\nit go away over time.\rI guess it ain’t nothin’ to worry\nabout. Bye!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0716_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rI found somethin’ weird.\nApparently there’s somethin’ called\fPokérus that infect homies.\rYeah, it’s like a virus, so it’s\ncalled Pokérus.\rIt spread fast and infect other\nhomies too. But that’s it.\rIt don’t seem to do nothin’, and\nit go away over time.\rI guess it ain’t nothin’ to worry\nabout. Bye!</language>
